  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Woolly mammoth-inspired static reconstruction with four supported feet, small ears and recurved tusks. The origin follows the documented mean of four sole centres, not the footprint bounding box; coat clumps, colour and individual proportions are artistic.",
    "zh": "猛犸象启发的静态复原，四足承地、小耳与回曲獠牙。原点采用记录的四个足底中心均值，而非足迹外接框；块状毛束、颜色和个体比例为艺术表达。"
  },
